      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": true,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$x^4-10x^3-5x^2+150x-216=0$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "如果没有专门的知识，要解这个方程是十分困难的。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "例 2　解方程",
        "$4x^4-5x^2+1=0$。　　　　　　　　　(4)",
        "为了解这个方程，引进代换$x^2=y$。于是，方程(4)化为关",
        "于$y$的二次方程：",
        "$4y^2-5y+1=0$。",
        "解这个方程，得出它和下列语句等价：",
        "$y=\\frac{1}{4}$　或　$y=1$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "就是说，方程(4)和下列语句等价：",
        "$x^2=\\frac{1}{4}$　或　$x^2=1$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "于是，$\\{-\\frac{1}{2},\\frac{1}{2}\\}$是方程$x^2=\\frac{1}{4}$的解集合，$\\{-1,1\\}$是方",
        "程$x^2=1$的解集合。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "方程(4)的解集合是这两个集合的并集，就是",
        "$\\{-\\frac{1}{2},\\frac{1}{2},-1,1\\}$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "上面讨论的方程是四次方程，它们属于$ax^4+bx^2+c=0$",
        "$(a\\ne0)$这种形式的方程。这种形式的方程叫做双二次方程。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "902",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "902. 利用引进新变量解下列方程：",
        "а) $(5x-1)^2+6(5x+1)-7=0$；",
        "б) $(x^2-9)^2-8(x^2-9)+7=0$；",
        "в) $(2a^2+3a)^2-7(2a^2+3a)=-10$；"
      ]
    },
